em deviates from its intended parameters. On what authority do you claim that we can bypass these fundamental safety requirements for the sake of speed, when the history of civil engineering and aviation demonstrates that unverified complexity is the primary vector for systemic collapse? Define your rollback mechanism and the authority that triggers it, or admit that your transition strategy relies on the hope that these systems will not fail in ways we cannot reverse.",
